    "created_at": "2026-06-19T07:25:44Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-06-19T07:25:44Z",
    "body": "FWIW \"script free only\" is available as a config like `new Sanitizer({})` or `div.setHTML(evil, {})`.\nYou can also reconfigure an existing sanitizer to remove all script elements and attributes with `mySanitizer.removeUnsafe()`",
